{"tool_name":"gnps","contents":["oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"gnps","home":"https://gnps.ucsd.edu/","license":"Other","summary":"GNPS is a web-based mass spectrometry ecosystem that aims to be an open-access knowledge base for community-wide organization and sharing of raw, processed, or annotated fragmentation mass spectrometry data (MS/MS). GNPS aids in identification and discovery throughout the entire life cycle of data; from initial data acquisition/analysis to post publication.","addition_date":"2021-05-26T20:04:08Z","last_update_date":"2025-11-03T16:45:43.961672Z","tool_type":["Workbench"],"accessibility":"Open access (with restrictions)","biotools_curie":"biotools:gnps","cost":"Free of charge (with restrictions)","credit":[{"email":"miw023@ucsd.edu","name":"Mingxun Wang","typeEntity":"Person","typeRole":["Primary contact"]}],"documentation":[{"type":["API documentation"],"url":"https://ccms-ucsd.github.io/GNPSDocumentation/api/"},{"type":["FAQ"],"url":"https://ccms-ucsd.github.io/GNPSDocumentation/faq/"},{"type":["General"],"url":"https://ccms-ucsd.github.io/GNPSDocumentation/"},{"type":["Quick start guide"],"url":"https://ccms-ucsd.github.io/GNPSDocumentation/quickstart/"}],"edit_permission":{"authors":["recetox-specdatri"],"type":"group"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Deisotoping","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3629"},{"term":"Deposition","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3431"},{"term":"Spectral counting","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3637"},{"term":"Spectral library search","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3801"}]}],"name":"GNPS","owner":"Kigaard","publication":[{"doi":"10.1038/NBT.3597","metadata":{"abstract":"\u00a9 2016 Nature America, Inc. All rights reserved.The potential of the diverse chemistries present in natural products (NP) for biotechnology and medicine remains untapped because NP databases are not searchable with raw data and the NP community has no way to share data other than in published papers. Although mass spectrometry (MS) techniques are well-suited to high-throughput characterization of NP, there is a pressing need for an infrastructure to enable sharing and curation of data. We present Global Natural Products Social Molecular Networking (GNPS; http://gnps.ucsd.edu), an open-access knowledge base for community-wide organization and sharing of raw, processed or identified tandem mass (MS/MS) spectrometry data. In GNPS, crowdsourced curation of freely available community-wide reference MS libraries will underpin improved annotations. Data-driven social-networking should facilitate identification of spectra and foster collaborations. We also introduce the concept of 'living data' through continuous reanalysis of deposited data.","authors":[{"name":"Agarwal V."},{"name":"Aigle B."},{"name":"Alexandrov T."},{"name":"Allard P.-M."},{"name":"Almaliti J."},{"name":"Bandeira N."},{"name":"Baric R."},{"name":"Boudreau P.D."},{"name":"Bouslimani A."},{"name":"Boya C.A.P."},{"name":"Briand E."},{"name":"Carlson E.E."},{"name":"Carver J.J."},{"name":"Charusanti P."},{"name":"Crusemann M."},{"name":"Dai J."},{"name":"Demarque D.P."},{"name":"Dorrestein K."},{"name":"Dorrestein P.C."},{"name":"Duggan B.M."},{"name":"Duncan K.R."},{"name":"Dutton R.J."},{"name":"Edlund A."},{"name":"Elfeki M."},{"name":"Engene N."},{"name":"Esquenazi E."},{"name":"Floros D.J."},{"name":"Garg N."},{"name":"Gavilan R.G."},{"name":"Gerwick L."},{"name":"Gerwick W.H."},{"name":"Glukhov E."},{"name":"Gonzalez D.J."},{"name":"Granatosky E.A."},{"name":"Gurr J."},{"name":"Gutierrez M."},{"name":"Helfrich E.J.N."},{"name":"Hoffman T."},{"name":"Houson H."},{"name":"Hsu C.-C."},{"name":"Humpf H.-U."},{"name":"Jadhav A."},{"name":"Jelsbak L."},{"name":"Jenkins S."},{"name":"Jensen P.R."},{"name":"Johnson A.R."},{"name":"Kapono C.A."},{"name":"Kersten R.D."},{"name":"Keyzers R.A."},{"name":"Kharbush J.J."},{"name":"Kleigrewe K."},{"name":"Klitgaard A."},{"na